## Hints for Future Agents
- duplicate-title is attached to the first plan of a group only, so `check <second-plan>` (and describe of it) does not show that finding. Pre-existing behaviour, left alone.
- planner describe already printed a plan's findings before this change; check <plan> adds the exit status and the table form.

## Codebase Discoveries
errors.Join(nil, err).Error() equals err.Error(), but the code still returns the bare summary when nothing is missing so the error type stays a plain fmt error.

